					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Umm, don't really need to nitpick&#8230; but how could Shirt get a posthumous reprimand if the world was already gone? I am of course, referencing to SCP-2317, &quot;THE DREAD DEVOURER, MAY HIS NAME REMAIN FOREVER UNREMEMBERED&quot;.</p> <p>Just sayin'.</p> <p>EDIT:<br /> And then I see the post about █,███,███,███ , and realize that this is, of course, intended. I also like the idea of this joke SCP happening in the the Site 19 containment breach game.</p> 
				 	]]>
