				<wikidot:authorName>augmentedspartan</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1775542</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I knew exactly what this was even before I finished the containment procedures. I was going to downvote because I didn't find it funny but then I got to the second log, which did make me chuckle, so I'll just no-vote.</p> <p>The problem with -J that are basically memes or common pop culture references is that unless they are really subtle or used as a punchline (something like <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-649-2568-j">this one</a>), they tend to not be that funny because the reader is very likely to know what the jokes are.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
